Dear Students,


We are pleased to inform you that *Dataoxy Technologies *wishes to hire
students of *B.Tech-(CS, DS, CY, AI&ML), BCA & MCA Batch 2027**.* Students
are advised to go through the description carefully and provide
their nomination for participation by filling the Google Form.


*Dates of drive*: Coming few days in Virtual or Physical mode. (As per
company=E2=80=99s discretion)


*Note: Students are required to provide the nominations before the
deadline. Post-deadline no entries will be considered for the
drive. Students who wish to take a dream slot are required to email the
dream slot application email on * *placement@jietjodhpur.ac.in
<placement@jietjodhpur.ac.in>*  * and fill the Google form before the
deadline. **(**Deadline: 17 September, 2026 till 8:00 AM**).*


*Eligibility Criteria:*

#  B.Tech-(CS, DS, CY, AI&ML), BCA & MCA Batch 2027

# Upto Four Backlogs.

# CAT-  *III*   .

# TCS-iON Active students.


*NOTE:  **I* and *II* category students can apply to companies in their own
category or lower category, provided they meet the company's above specific
eligibility criteria. Meaning *I* category students can apply for *II* &
*III* category companies and *II* category students can apply for
*III* category
companies.*As we have one student one placement policy* - give
your nomination only after going through the job profile carefully and if
you wish to join the company post selection.


*List of eligible students for the Google form is attached herewith.*


*About the Company: Dataoxy Technologies *own Excellency in crafting ideas
into reality with 8 years of experience in IT Solutions, we give life to
imaginations. With 100+ completed projects and 100% satisfaction, we are
leading in the market as top Startups Expansion Company. We started Dataoxy
Technologies why? We Believe, that Expertized with Structured Software
Design & Development As on Customer Expectations and Satisfaction


*Website: https://www.dataoxytechnologies.com/
<https://www.dataoxytechnologies.com/>*


*Job Roles: *IT Sales Intern



*Job Description: *



*Key Responsibilities:*
1. Lead generation and client acquisition for IT solutions
2. Cold Calling
3. Product & Servies Demonstration
4. Handling client communications and relationship management
5. Preparing sales presentations and proposals
6. Assisting in market research and competitor analysis



*Compensation:*



*Stipend:* =E2=82=B910,000 per month

*Internship Duration:* 3 Months and full time

Upon successful completion, interns may also be considered for full-time
opportunities based on performance.



*INR CTC upto 4 lakh per annum* after successful completion of internship



*Components in Salary*

*Monthly (INR)*

*Annually (INR)*

